[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234013839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110058#issuecomment-3234013839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110058","id":3234013839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AwyKP","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T15:38:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T15:38:53Z","body":"Can you upload a testing project which can be used to benchmark this?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234013839/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234020511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110058#issuecomment-3234020511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110058","id":3234020511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Awzyf","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T15:40:57Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T15:40:57Z","body":"Did you profile this? This code should be trivially vectorized by the compiler already.\r\n\r\nI haven't worked on `blit_rect` at all. But I did extensively test `Image::_convert` and couldn't beat the performance of the automatic vectorization that the compiler does already. It is similar in that it copies over one pixel at a time. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234020511/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234210040","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110058#issuecomment-3234210040","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110058","id":3234210040,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AxiD4","user":{"login":"Rinnegatamante","id":9152710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNTI3MTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9152710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante","html_url":"https://github.com/Rinnegatamante","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T16:41:09Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T16:41:09Z","body":"In a specific use case on Nintendo Switch (for which I can't really share) we did see an improvement of roughly 22 seconds (we generate a lot of npcs via atlases that get combined at runtime via a couple of blits). The whole process took 1 minute and 32 seconds with previous code whilst it takes 1 minute and 11 seconds with the per-line copy. \r\n\r\nI can see to create a small reproducible sample project for benching it also on other devices.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234210040/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234358850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110058#issuecomment-3234358850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110058","id":3234358850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AyGZC","user":{"login":"Rinnegatamante","id":9152710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNTI3MTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9152710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante","html_url":"https://github.com/Rinnegatamante","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T17:33:28Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T17:34:34Z","body":"Here's a small project to bench this and here's the result for my specific setup. (The code has been ran on Godot 4.3.1 since that's the one we use but the same applies for current upstream).\r\n\r\n[blit.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22030349/blit.zip)\r\n\r\nWith original blit_rect code:\r\n```\r\nGodot Engine v4.3.1.stable.custom_build.370864999 (2025-08-20 17:11:15 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\nVulkan 1.4.312 - Forward Mobile - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti\r\n\r\nStart\r\nEnd in 24960\r\nStart\r\nEnd in 24739\r\nStart\r\nEnd in 24744\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith per-line code:\r\n```\r\nGodot Engine v4.3.1.stable.custom_build.fae954344 (2025-08-28 15:03:58 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\nVulkan 1.4.312 - Forward Mobile - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti\r\n\r\nStart\r\nEnd in 5588\r\nStart\r\nEnd in 5418\r\nStart\r\nEnd in 5600\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis code also doesn't actually hit the full rect copy which would realistically also give an even higher benefit.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234358850/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234367807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110058#issuecomment-3234367807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110058","id":3234367807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AyIk_","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T17:35:17Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T17:35:17Z","body":"Ooooooh, those are very nice results!\r\n\r\nTo confirm, you have full optimizations enabled in both builds right? ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234367807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234401853","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110058#issuecomment-3234401853","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110058","id":3234401853,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AyQ49","user":{"login":"Rinnegatamante","id":9152710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNTI3MTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9152710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante","html_url":"https://github.com/Rinnegatamante","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T17:45:34Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T17:46:01Z","body":"The results are from an editor regular build (so speed_trace one, which is O2). The Switch gain was from a release build instead. I can re-run the test on release build as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234401853/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234438970","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110058#issuecomment-3234438970","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110058","id":3234438970,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AyZ86","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T17:59:38Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T17:59:38Z","body":"> The results are from an editor regular build (so speed_trace one, which is O2). The Switch gain was from a release build instead. I can re-run the test on release build as well.\r\n\r\nThanks for confirming. I just wanted to make sure that optimizations were on, no need to test again. \r\n\r\nI guess auto-vectorization can only do so much here and simply can't compete with the case where you can just memcpy the whole thing at once","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234438970/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3236375818","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110058#issuecomment-3236375818","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110058","id":3236375818,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7A5y0K","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-29T09:29:22Z","updated_at":"2025-08-29T09:57:00Z","body":"> I guess auto-vectorization can only do so much here and simply can't compete with the case where you can just memcpy the whole thing at once\n\nTo add some context: Vectorization can at most use the latest SIMD we have enabled (SSE4.2). `memcpy` uses the best SIMD Operation available in the CPU.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3236375818/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3254620764","html_url":"https://github.